    "long_instructions": "# Investigate & Debug\r\n\r\nThis program paints a path around the block wall but the painter should be painting a zig-zag path to get to the food truck.\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n\r\nRun the program to see what the painter is doing. Debug the starter code and then add another loop so that the Painter makes their way down to the food truck like in the image below. \r\n\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://images.code.org/886099cd59c7dfabbb01aa0743c07978-image-1794519366166.png\" style=\"width: 200px;\">",
